The CDB039 integration test invokes `codedb export runner_proof_manifest` as a
noninteractive runner would, with explicit repository ID, repository path,
store path, and each JSON, NUON, and CSV format. JSON rows are asserted to
carry the gate, status, evidence, raw-log, and provenance-forbidden fields.
`release_readiness` remains `pending`: CodeDB emits proof rows, while runner
retains release-readiness authority.
